{"id":"prepositions-0150","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 150","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Plastic waste is a serious threat ___ marine life.","hint":"threat ___ sth/sb","explanation":"a threat TO somebody/something."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":["under","at","for","to"],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The dispute was referred ___ arbitration at the request of both unions.","hint":"refer sth ___ arbitration","explanation":"\u0027Refer something to arbitration\u0027 = send it to an independent body to be settled."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The government raised the tax ___ cigarettes again.","hint":"tax ___ sth","explanation":"a tax ON something."},{"answer":"on","accept":["upon"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"We rely ___ public transport to get to work.","hint":"rely ___ sb/sth","explanation":"rely ON (upon) somebody/something."},{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He was found guilty ___ fraud.","hint":"guilty ___ sth","explanation":"guilty OF a crime."},{"answer":"about","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Don\u0027t worry ___ the exam \u2014 you\u0027re well prepared.","hint":"worry ___ sth","explanation":"worry ABOUT somebody/something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The surgeon operated ___ the patient for four hours.","hint":"operate ___ sb","explanation":"operate ON a patient (for a condition)."},{"answer":"in","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Three workers were involved ___ the accident.","hint":"involved ___ sth","explanation":"be involved IN an activity/accident."}]}